# =============================================================================
# DevSecOps Toolbox — Default Configuration
# =============================================================================
#
# This file contains default values for all configuration variables.
# It is loaded last (lowest priority) by Taskfile's dotenv mechanism.
#
# ENVIRONMENT LAYERING (loaded by priority, first wins):
#   .env       → Production/staging overrides (gitignored, never versioned)
#   .env.dev   → Development defaults (versioned, safe for local dev)
#   .env.dist  → Base defaults (versioned, no secrets)
#
# In production: delete .env.dev, create .env with real values.
# In development: .env.dev provides working defaults out of the box.
#
# TOOLBOX CONFIGURATION VARIABLES
# -------------------------------
# All toolbox-specific configuration variables should be prefixed with 'TASK_'
# and defined below. These variables control various aspects of the toolbox's
# behaviour and integration with external tools and services.
#
# =============================================================================
# Additional TASK_ variables should be added below this section
# =============================================================================

# TASK_XXX=value

# GitLab CE (test instance)
TASK_GITLAB_WEB_PORT=8929
TASK_GITLAB_ROOT_USER=root
TASK_GITLAB_ROOT_PASSWORD=devsecops-toolbox-password
